were added. Includes 27 independent-loss and 30 common-loss cases.
Coverage includes analytic material integrals, independent contact matrices
on NumPy/JAX/Torch engines, passivity and absorption, fifteen live JAX
parameters, contact and lossless-boundary derivatives, and disappearance of
a collapsed interval's unused complex material.

