All checks passed. git diff --check: passed.

The 1e-8 cell residual, 2e-12 mesh CDF and lossless 1e-9 Hermitian guards
remain. The complex physical closure additionally checks positive storage
and nonnegative dissipation with an absolute 1e-9 roundoff allowance, without
modifying its matrices. No optical or derivative threshold was relaxed.

Scope: finite positive-real-part scalar permittivities, nonnegative physical
imaginary parts, nonmagnetic materials, and the existing orthogonal rectangle
profiles. Loss can vary independently in each shape and background. The
real study kernels keep their original eight-coefficient layout; the complex
subclass adds the independent yx energy coefficient. General geometry,
nonpositive real permittivities, automatic projector selection and optical
convergence qualification remain separate work.
